escape?" Markos looked thoughtful. "I doubt it," he

38
00:03:29.464 --> 00:03:32.531
said. "I mean, of course he was angry at the

39
00:03:32.532 --> 00:03:38.331
time. You're lucky he didn't turn us all into frogs or something." He

40
00:03:38.332 --> 00:03:43.336
shuddered. "However, I'm sure he's mostly forgotten about it by

41
